toka rec 1 wln wst w0 w1 hh nv flg
tka call tokput tk ntk toka
ntka add ntk endn
bdb call bput bd nbk ntka
nlv select nl 1 0
nbkb add nbk nlv
pvn select pval 1 0
tokb rec ke 1 p1 0 0 0 0 0
tkb call tokput tka ntka tokb
ntkb add ntka pvn
z0 eq wln 0
ue and upd z0
wstn select ue p1 wst
wlna add wln 1
wlnn select upd wlna 0
lt4 lt wln 4
m1 mul w0 256
m2 add m1 c
w0a select lt4 m2 w0
w0n select upd w0a 0
ge4 ge wln 4
lt8 lt wln 8
g48 and ge4 lt8
m3 mul w1 256
m4 add m3 c
